# --- Covered by a NESTED .gitignore, which --ignore-path does not read -------
#
# `--ignore-path .gitignore` reads exactly that one file. Anything ignored by
# apps/*/.gitignore or packages/*/.gitignore is invisible to it, so build output
# under a workspace-local ignore reaches prettier anyway and fails
# `format:check` on a file nobody wrote and nobody can usefully format.
#
# apps/study-group-finder/.gitignore
**/.dart_tool/
